---
title: "Accept command flags only with nonempty, distinct settings"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Read first setting
  s1: Invalid flags rejected
  s2: Read next setting
  s3: All settings read
  s4: Command flags accepted
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Reject empty value
  s0 --> s2: Store setting value
  s2 --> s1: Reject empty value or Reject repeated setting
  s2 --> s3: Store setting value
  s3 --> s4: Return parsed flags
